<title>GERMANY: German Jan/Nov 1996 coffee imports higher.</title>
<headline>German Jan/Nov 1996 coffee imports higher.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>German net green coffee imports from outside the EU totalled 10.95 million bags in January-November 1996 compared with 10.62 million in the same period a year earlier, the DKV coffee association said.</p>
<p>Imports of 1.06 million bags in November 1996 exceeded those in November 1995 at 1.04 million but were below 1.11 million in October 1996.</p>
<p>Brazil shipped 188,602 bags in November after 143,815 in October, Colombia 160,187 (208,979), Indonesia 93,345 (87,241), Papua New Guinea 83,096 (103,304) and Kenya 66,470 (78,469).</p>
<p>--Hamburg newsroom +49-40-41903275</p>
